---
component: inesAt
# Ines wherever the schedule puts her: the scene change, her entrance, then
# the beat's own lines. One header for her three places.
params:
  where: { type: { entity: place } }
  bg: string
  time: { type: { enum: [morning, afternoon, night] } }
  side: { type: { enum: [left, center, right] }, default: center }
beat:
  on: visit
  target: "place.@where"
  once: "false"
  priority: 5
  when: "holds('at', ['ines', @where])"
---

## Ines

::bg{location=@bg time=@time}
::use{component="enter" who="ines" side=@side instance="use-001"}
::body
